# KQM Vodyanitsa quick guide, Neuvillette / Xilonen / Kazuha team:
# Neuvillette E > Kazuha tEP > Xilonen EQ N2 > Vodyanitsa EQ > Kazuha Q
# tEP > Neuvillette C E C Q > Xilonen E N2 > Vodyanitsa EQ > Kazuha tEP >
# Neuvillette 2[C], as written. C is Neuvillette's charged attack
